{"name": "Foxy The First Steps", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Foxy: The First Steps</strong> is a precision platformer focused on execution, movement mastery, and repetition. Each stage is a single-screen challenge: grab the key crystal, overcome obstacles, and reach the portal to advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/3edef9425ae73fd135623b3081f1a28f.poster.avif?t=1783661164\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/3edef9425ae73fd135623b3081f1a28f.webm?t=1783661164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/3edef9425ae73fd135623b3081f1a28f.mp4?t=1783661164\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete short, high-intensity precision stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab the key crystal and reach the portal to clear each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fail? Instant restart with smooth transition \u2014 keep the flow going</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Responsive movement with full character control</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/594faae8a91907e1696974fb4d9629b3.poster.avif?t=1783661164\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/594faae8a91907e1696974fb4d9629b3.webm?t=1783661164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/594faae8a91907e1696974fb4d9629b3.mp4?t=1783661164\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pressure-based jumping (height varies depending on input)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wall sliding and wall jumping for advanced navigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenges that demand precise timing and reaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New mechanics introduced with each set of stages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/cb7c5bf04d0bd1c6660251d9377694cb.poster.avif?t=1783661164\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/cb7c5bf04d0bd1c6660251d9377694cb.webm?t=1783661164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/cb7c5bf04d0bd1c6660251d9377694cb.mp4?t=1783661164\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combo &amp; Collectibles System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage has 20 optional crystals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect them in the correct order to build combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect combos grant bonus scoring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replay stages to improve execution and score</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/a07b20cc5d197b8e65d32832ca6fc8bb.poster.avif?t=1783661164\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/a07b20cc5d197b8e65d32832ca6fc8bb.webm?t=1783661164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/a07b20cc5d197b8e65d32832ca6fc8bb.mp4?t=1783661164\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Secrets</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rare codices appear when all crystals are collected</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover hidden elements that expand the game world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/1b28afa9c9d9d8c4cd41060c466876bd.poster.avif?t=1783661164\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/1b28afa9c9d9d8c4cd41060c466876bd.webm?t=1783661164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/1b28afa9c9d9d8c4cd41060c466876bd.mp4?t=1783661164\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenge &amp; Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">150 levels with increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Linear progression with stage unlocking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional timer for speedruns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenges designed for full mastery and best time completion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872720/extras/c0d21d9b6955db5ad56fefbc7fe38545.poster.avif?t=1783661164\" widt